tip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.center{left:50%;margin-left:-125px;right:auto}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.center.narrow{margin-left:-50px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.center.fill{left:-262px;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;right:-262px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.center.wide{margin-left:-225px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.right{left:auto;right:0px}</style><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Leather\" title=\"Leather\">Leather</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Leather\" title=\"Leather\">Leather</a>:</b> <b>Leather</b> armor is made of the hide of animals. It provides decent protection without excessively restricting the user's movements.</span></span> \n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Hardness\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\">12\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\" width=\"150\">Base Value\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\" width=\"450\"><span style=\"display: none;\">0010020000</span>10,020<span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\">pp<span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"/page/Currency\" title=\"Currency\">Platinum Piece</a></span></span>&#160;\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Weight\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\">0.10 lbs\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Location\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\"><b><a href=\"/page/House_Cannith_Manufactury\" title=\"House Cannith Manufactury\">House Cannith Manufactury</a></b>, <a href=\"/page/Bulat\" title=\"Bulat\">Bulat</a>'s chest (Rare encounter)&#160;; <a href=\"/page/Schemes_of_the_Enemy\" title=\"Schemes of the Enemy\">Schemes of the Enemy</a>, <a href=\"/page/Dackle\" title=\"Dackle\">Dackle's</a> chest (only on Normal difficulty)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Enchantments\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Intelligence\" title=\"Intelligence\"> Intelligence +6</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Intelligence\" title=\"Intelligence\"> Intelligence +6</a></b>: This item focuses the power of the wearer's mind, granting a +6 <a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">Enhancement bonus</a> to Intelligence.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Treason_(enchantment)\" title=\"Treason (enchantment)\">Treason</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Treason_(enchantment)\" title=\"Treason (enchantment)\">Treason</a>:</b> This item reduces the <a href=\"/page/Threat\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Threat\">threat</a> generated by melee damage by 20%.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Disable_Device\" title=\"Disable Device\">Disable Device +10</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Disable_Device\" title=\"Disable Device\">Disable Device +10</a>:</b> Passive: +10 <a href=\"/page/Competence_bonus\" title=\"Competence bonus\">Competence bonus</a> to the <a href=\"/page/Disable_Device\" title=\"Disable Device\">Disable Device</a> skill.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Disable_Device\" title=\"Disable Device\">Enhanced&#32;Disable Device +5</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Disable_Device\" title=\"Disable Device\">Enhanced&#32;Disable Device +5</a>:</b> Passive: +5 <a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">Enhancement bonus</a> to the <a href=\"/page/Disable_Device\" title=\"Disable Device\">Disable Device</a> skill.</span></span></li>\n<li><a href=\"/page/Nearly_Finished\" title=\"Nearly Finished\">Nearly Finished</a> - <span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Named_item_sets#Tinker&#39;s_Finesse\" title=\"Named item sets\">Tinker's Finesse</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Named_item_sets#Tinker&#39;s_Finesse\" title=\"Named item sets\">Tinker's Finesse</a>:</b> <a href=\"/page/True_Seeing_(enchantment)\" title=\"True Seeing (enchantment)\">True Seeing</a>, and equivalent to <a href=\"/page/Sneak_Attack_Bonus\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Sneak Attack Bonus\">Sneak Attack Bonus +5</a>: Provides a +5 to attack rolls and +8 damage for any attack that would qualify as a Sneak Attack, even if the wielder is not a Rogue.</span></span></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1; vertical-align: middle;\" rowspan=\"4\" align=\"center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Tinker%27s_Goggles.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Tinker%27s_Goggles.png/420px-Tinker%27s_Goggles.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"388\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Tinker%27s_Goggles.png 1.5x\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Upgradeable?\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\"><a href=\"/page/Nearly_Finished\" title=\"Nearly Finished\">Nearly Finished</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Description\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\"><i>Goggles worn by House Cannith tinkers to enhance their vision, aiding them in working with small or intricate mechanisms.</i>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Tips\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\">\n<p><b>Notes:</b> \n</p>\n<ul><li>The <a href=\"/page/True_Seeing_(item_enchantment)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"True Seeing (item enchantment)\">True Seeing</a> effect from the set bonus is bugged and doesn't work, but the <a href=\"/page/Sneak_Attack\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Sneak Attack\">Sneak Attack</a> bonus does. UPDATE: As of U12.3 this effect is now working properly, but you may have to re-equip them after death (like other effects such as <a href=\"/page/Tira%27s_Splendor\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Tira&#39;s Splendor\">Tira's Splendor</a>). Tested by viewing the astral bug on the rune arm, <a href=\"/page/Lucid_Dreams\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Lucid Dreams\">Lucid Dreams</a>.</li></ul>\n<table border=\"0\" align=\"center\">\n<tbody><tr><td align=\"center\"><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/1_Tinker%27s_Goggles.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"34\" height=\"31\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></span></span><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"> Tinker's Goggles</span></span> + <span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/1_Pliable_Ingot.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"34\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></span></span><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"> 1 Pliable Ingot</span></span> + <span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/1_Metallic_Ingot.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"34\" height=\"31\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></span></span><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"> 1 Metallic Ingot</span></span> + <span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/1_Dense_Ingot.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"34\" height=\"31\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></span></span><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"> 1 Dense Ingot</span></span> + <span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/1_Lesser_Cannith_Power_Cell.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"34\" height=\"31\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></span></span><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"